      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I am in B.Tech Computer Engineering, Semester 4. Based on my active timetable, I have a lab on Monday from 2:00 PM to 4:30 PM. If I want to register for an extra backlog course from the AI branch (Semester 4), what is the maximum number of total credits I can carry this semester, and what logistical conflict might I face on Mondays?"
